# CITATION.cff
#
# Citation metadata for ARVIS, in the Citation File Format 1.2.0.
# GitHub reads this file to render the "Cite this repository" button,
# and reference managers read it directly.
#
# The preferred citation is the preprint, not the repository: the
# paper is what states the claims, the limits and the validation
# protocol, and it carries a permanent DOI. The preprint describes
# software version 0.1.0b7; no version string appears here on
# purpose, because a version pinned in two places drifts (the
# authoritative ones are pyproject.toml and CHANGELOG.md).
#
# The DOI below is pinned by tests/docs/test_citation_metadata.py
# against the badge and the "Citing ARVIS" section of README.md, so
# the three citation surfaces cannot disagree.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ARVIS in academic work, please cite the preprint below.
title: ARVIS
abstract: >-
  An open-source runtime assurance kernel for LLM-based systems: a
  monotone fail-closed verdict lattice over proposed acts, evidence-grade
  auditability with bit-identical deterministic replay, and Lyapunov-based
  runtime monitoring with measured rather than assumed constants.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lefauconnier
    given-names: Julien
    affiliation: VeraMem
    email: admin@veramem.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Julien-Lefauconnier/arvis
url: https://julien-lefauconnier.github.io/arvis/
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - runtime assurance
  - AI governance
  - large language models
  - Lyapunov stability
  - deterministic replay
  - auditability

preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    ARVIS: A Runtime Assurance Kernel for LLM-Based Systems with
    Deterministic Replay and Pre-Registered Empirical Validation
  authors:
    - family-names: Lefauconnier
      given-names: Julien
      affiliation: VeraMem
      email: admin@veramem.com
  year: 2026
  month: 9
  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22280253
  url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22280253
  publisher:
    name: Zenodo
  notes: >-
    Preprint. Describes ARVIS software version 0.1.0b7.
